// An APNG has at most 268435456 pixels, as many as stb_image reads back, and encoding a larger
// one panics where it's encoded, before its frames are looked at.
Import std.core
Import std.image

Local most = Animation(268435456, 1)
Print(most.Width * most.Height)
Png.EncodeAnimation(Animation(268435457, 1))
